DESCRIPTION:School status: schools open\nCalculated from calendar: these da
 tes are grouped or inferred from published entries.\nMarch 22 is a profess
 ional day without student classes\, making March 23 the next scheduled stu
 dent day after spring break. This return date is inferred from the publish
 ed calendar. If the March 15-16 hurricane reserves are activated\, student
 s may have additional attendance days during the break.\nSource: https://f
 iles.smartsites.parentsquare.com/10061/lnnrtrqrjc7o9aidbma.pdf\nCalendar s
 cope: Hernando County School District regular 2026-2027 Student Calendar. 
 Bell times apply only to each school or row identified in the separate app
 roved bell schedule\; the Eastside row is labeled ES. Four break dates are
  reserved for possible hurricane make-up and are currently planned without
  student classes. Confirm charter\, virtual\, technical-college and other 
 separate program calendars directly.
